<title>UK: DSL Finance prices 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Finance prices 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced earlier by lead manager Bayerische Vereinsbank has been priced.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL FINANCE NV</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  DSL BANK DEUTSCHE SIEDLUNGS-UND LANDESRENTENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.0	 MATURITY    23.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.02    PAY DATE    23.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.25	REOFFER    99.07     SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
